{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Serphonica 是一款專為樂手而設的聽力訓練應用程式，把音程辨識、和絃聽辨、音階練習、節奏與視譜訓練集於一身，並內置調音器及節拍器等實用工具，適合剛接觸音樂理論的初學者，也適合希望持續磨練耳朵的資深樂手。程式原價 US $0.99，現於 App Store 限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>麥克風即時偵測練耳</h2>\n<p>Serphonica 以裝置麥克風偵測你演奏的音高，無需 MIDI 線材，吉他、低音結他、烏克麗麗、鋼琴、人聲或任何有音高的樂器皆可使用。音程訓練、和絃辨識、音階練習、節奏回聲、視譜與旋律記憶等練習逐一拆解，內置實時調音器、節拍器、互動指板與參考圖表，初學者可從基礎音程入手，有經驗的樂手亦可持續磨練聽力。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-444-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-445-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-446-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-447-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-448-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-449-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Serphonica</li>\n<li>應用類別：Music</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T14:38:13.657646+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":343,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}